	<item>
		<title>Say hello</title>
		<link>/contact/</link>
		<pubDate>2026-08-30 12:00:00</pubDate>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[admin]]></dc:creator>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">/?p=103</guid>
		<description></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p class="prose__lead">One of us reads everything that comes in, usually within a day. If it is about an existing order, include the order number and it will be much faster.</p>
  <div class="contact__grid">
    <div>
      <h2 class="prose__sub">Email</h2>
      <p><a class="link" href="mailto:hello@feathermoss.com">hello@feathermoss.com</a></p>
      <h2 class="prose__sub">Instagram</h2>
      <p><a class="link" href="https://instagram.com/feathermoss" rel="noopener">@feathermoss</a>, where we post what is on the bench.</p>
      <h2 class="prose__sub">The studio</h2>
      <p>San Diego, California. Visits by arrangement, since it is a working bench and not a shop.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h2 class="prose__sub">Wholesale and press</h2>
      <p>We work with a small number of stockists. If you run a shop and think the pieces would suit it, send through your shop name and a link and we will come back to you.</p>
      <p>For press, high resolution images and product details are available on request.</p>
      <h2 class="prose__sub">Repairs</h2>
      <p>Send a photo of what went wrong along with roughly when you bought it. Most things are fixable and most repairs are free.</p>
    </div>
  </div>]]></content:encoded>
		<excerpt:encoded><![CDATA[]]></excerpt:encoded>
		<wp:post_id>103</wp:post_id>
