	</item>
	<item>
		<title>Stockists and where to find us</title>
		<link>/stockists/</link>
		<pubDate>2026-08-30 12:00:00</pubDate>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[admin]]></dc:creator>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">/?p=106</guid>
		<description></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p class="prose__lead">Most of what we make goes out from this site, but a handful of shops carry a small edit.</p>
  <h2 class="prose__sub">California</h2>
  <p>Two shops in San Diego carry the Fruit Stand and Candy Counter pieces, and one in Los Angeles takes the full necklace range. Ask for us by name and they will know.</p>
  <h2 class="prose__sub">Markets</h2>
  <p>We do a small number of markets a year, mostly around San Diego, and we announce them on Instagram about two weeks out. That is the only place everything is available to try on at once.</p>
  <h2 class="prose__sub">Want to stock us</h2>
  <p>We are choosy about this, not out of grandness but because five people can only make so much. If your shop feels right, send a link through the contact page and tell us what your customers already buy.</p>]]></content:encoded>
		<excerpt:encoded><![CDATA[]]></excerpt:encoded>
		<wp:post_id>106</wp:post_id>
		<wp:post_date><![CDATA[2026-08-30 12:00:00]]></wp:post_date>
